<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.pioneer.builds ~ mint an ephemeral pioneer sensorium

`name` names the pioneer and `half-life` its decay. An operator's retire at a terminal undoes it.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///sense.pioneer.builds", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ name · half-life · ephemeral

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<name> ~ the sensorium by name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`half-life` params=`takes/count skins/mcp ~ the pioneer's decay`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`ephemeral` params=`skins/cli ~ the pioneer stands ephemeral, the one shape the terminal mints`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sense build

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sense build]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///sense.pioneer.builds

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///sense.pioneer.builds]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

